,\r\n12:       \"OFFICIAL_SOURCE_PAGE9_EXCERPT.txt (0733c1e3…)\",\r\n13:       \"CROSSWALK_ROW_0141_AND_NEIGHBORS.json (d09422ce…), including I19-E29/E30/E32 neighbours\",\r\n14:       \"UNIQUE_BLUEPRINT_0141_I19-E31_R02.md (e1976164…)\",\r\n15:       \"SOURCE_PACKET_0141_I19-E31_R02.md (43c0e1bd…)\",\r\n16:       \"QUESTIONNAIRE_ITEMS_0141_R01.csv (310745e5…)\",\r\n17:       \"SAMPLE_PERIOD_SUMMARY_0141_R01.csv (537c39dc…)\",\r\n18:       \"SAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_REGISTER_0141_R05.csv (5fff0f9b…)\"\r\n19:     ],\r\n20:     \"not_inherited\": \"The prior exact-SHA R04 PASS (a0dfec32…) and its six minor findings were treated as context to be re-verified, not as a verdict for this SHA.\",\r\n21:     \"not_adjudicated\": \"Word-native layout/pagination, chart geometry, font floors and the 25-page visual receipt (5076475e…) are a separate lane; they are corroborating context only and are not re-adjudicated here.\",\r\n22:     \"status_boundaries\": \"REAL evidence = UNKNOWN/HOLD; Official score = NOT_ASSIGNED; Human formal acceptance = NOT_GRANTED. This PASS is semantic-only for the exact SHA above and promotes nothing.\"\r\n23:   },\r\n24:   \"requirement_mapping\": {\r\n25:     \"official_requirement\": \"I19-E31, indicator 19, official criterion 「顧客滿意度提升。」, source = TTQS training-institution scoring evidence table, physical PDF page 9 (page extraction SHA 945949f3…).\",\r\n26:     \"official_label_reading\": \"「4分」 appears inside the 1–5 計分標準 tier list on the page-9 extract; the extract shows no weight column. The document states this correctly at §貳-一 and in the 報告基本資訊 table (「將 4 分列在 1–5 分計分級距中，未顯示為權重欄」), and does not assert a weight, an association score or evaluator-granted points.\",\r\n27:     \"identity_triangulation\": \"doc_id 0141, requirement I19-E31 and 157 index 155 are carried as three distinct identifiers in the header table, §貳-一 and 附錄五-2; printed checkbox serial is declared UNKNOWN rather than guessed.\",\r\n28:     \"title_provenance\": \"The title 「顧客滿意度趨勢調查與分析報告」 is attributed to the 129→142 crosswalk I19-E31/0141 row and explicitly not to the page-9 PDF text (header table 「文件名稱來源」) — matches the crosswalk row and the Blueprint B note.\",\r\n29:     \"blueprint_D_coverage\": {\r\n30:       \"cover_status_D1\": \"Header table + 壹 declares whole-document SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC and REAL=UNKNOWN/HOLD.\",\r\n31:       \"executive_finding_D2\": \"§壹-一/二 give three-period means, 15/12 denominators, Q6 as weakest dimension, interpretation and limits.\",\r\n32:       \"comparability_protocol_D3\": \"§參-I/II/III/IV: audience definition, single synthetic segment, invitation-unit denominator rule, four comparability conditions, small-cell SAMPLE caveat.\",\r\n33:       \"administration_SOP_D4\": \"§肆-I/II: dispatch timing, two-reminder cap, close at day 5, dedup, invalidity rules, no-imputation, item-specific valid n, 5/6 personal-index threshold.\",\r\n34:       \"questionnaire_D5\": \"§伍-一/二: full 1–5 anchor definitions, N/A handling, 8 items with metadata fields; Q8 explicitly excluded from numeric means.\",\r\n35:       \"results_D6\": \"§陸-I/II/III/IV: invitation/valid/return counts, six item means with n=12, separate Q7 mean and Top-2 table, multi-period table and same-axis line chart with caption note.\",\r\n36:       \"interpretation_D7\": \"§柒-一/二: 2023→2024, 2024→2025 and baseline→final deltas, weakest item Q6, sample-size sensitivity, no-causality and single-segment limitations.\",\r\n37:       \"sample_loop_D8\": \"§捌: two proposals with IDs, retrospective framing, proposed role, future check window, success measure, HOLD/REVISE rule, NOT_ADOPTED/NOT_EXECUTED status.\",\r\n38:       \"limitations_decision_D9\": \"§捌 次期資料判讀與處置表 (CONTINUE/CHANGE/HOLD with required evidence) plus §柒-二.\",\r\n39:       \"appendices_D10\": \"附錄一 blank printable form, 附錄二 filled SAMPLE example, 附錄三 36-row dataset, 附錄四 dictionary/formulas/label table, 附錄五 register template and revision history.\"\r\n40:     },\r\n41:     \"blueprint_I_reject_checks\": \"None of the 13 reject/hold conditions is triggered by this text: IDs are not conflated; a filled SAMPLE example plus 36 rows exist; scale/wording held constant with an explicit TREND_NOT_COMPARABLE_HOLD rule; denominators and per-item n stated; N/A/blank not imputed or zeroed; Likert deltas labelled in points, not percent growth; nonresponse handled by invitation denominator and gate rule 7; segment blending prohibited; synthetic status labelled on every table; satisfaction not substituted for licensing/employment/system-use/revenue; causality explicitly barred; owner roles, checkpoints and HOLD rules supplied; SHA/source locators attached.\"\r\n42:   },\r\n43:   \"document_genre_and_usability\": {\r\n44:     \"genre\": \"調査與分析報告 (survey and analysis report) — not a scoring sheet, not a blank questionnaire, not an information-system uptake report, not a licensing/employment report, not a revenue report.\",\r\n45:     \"title_blind_identification\": \"Reading only the body, an evaluator would identify a three-period customer-satisfaction trend report with protocol, instrument, statistics, limits and a proposal loop.\",\r\n46:     \"practical_field_usability\": \"Usable before launch: the invitation unit and denominator rule (§參-II), dispatch/reminder/close timings (§肆-I), dedup and invalidity rules (§肆-II), the printable blank form (附錄一) and the filled example (附錄二) are all present. The 附錄四 dictionary now carries record_state, response_date_synthetic and customer_segment with vocabularies, so a future REAL export can be validated against the dictionary rather than the raw CSV header.\",\r\n47:     \"evaluator_facing_readability\": \"Sections are numbered and cross-referenced (柒-一 points to 附錄四's label table; 方案二 points to 附錄四's item-level Top-2 formula; 陸-四's caption disambiguates the pooled index from any single item). Warning blocks and SAMPLE labels appear on every results table.\",\r\n48:     \"label_consistency\": \"Short labels 需求契合/情境對應/師資支援/教材資源/行政溝通/環境設備/整體滿意 are used in §陸-二, §柒-一 and 附錄四, and §柒-一 now states that these are the single label source with no new aliases; 附錄四 fixes Q4＝教材資源 and Q6＝環境設備. Residual descriptive parentheticals in §壹-四 (e.g. 「Q5（行政溝通與課前通知）」, 「Q6（學習環境與設備）」) are the only remaining alias-like strings — cosmetic, see minor finding 4.\"\r\n49:   },\r\n50:   \"sample_real_boundary\": {\r\n51:     \"labelling\": \"Header table, §壹, §陸-I, 附錄二, 附錄三 row column 「資料屬性狀態」 and 附錄五 all state SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC; every 36 rows carries record_state=SAMPLE_SYNTHETIC and Q8='SAMPLE_ONLY; no actual respondent text'.\",\r\n52:     \"real_status\": \"REAL = UNKNOWN / HOLD in the header table, §拾-二-1 and the closing line; 保存期限 UNKNOWN / REFER_TO_APPROVED_POLICY.\",\r\n53:     \"authority_boundary\": \"§捌 次期 table step 3 (由協會實際授權人員決定) plus §拾-一 step 5 and §拾-二-4 state that computation alone never promotes: 「CURRENT ≠ REAL，也不等於正式接受」 and 「Human formal acceptance 未授予」. No meeting decision, signature, approval, certificate, third-party original or external achievement is fabricated.\",\r\n54:     \"synthetic_segment\": \"Exactly one segment (TRAINING_PARTICIPANT_SYNTHETIC) exists in the 36 rows; §參-I and §柒-二-4 state that no corporate-client or other segment is surveyed and that no segment comparison may be drawn. No unsupported inference to other segments is made.\",\r\n55:     \"no_causality\": \"§壹-二, §柒-一-5, §柒-二-3 and gate rule 11 bar any claim that the two proposals caused the Q5/Q2/Q7 movement; the proposals are labelled retrospective demonstrations with NOT_ADOPTED/NOT_EXECUTED status.\"\r\n56:   },\r\n57:   \"math_and_data\": {\r\n58:     \"method\": \"Recomputed from the 36 raw rows without using the R01 period summary or the R05 math receipt as authority.\",\r\n59:     \"per_item_means_recomputed\": {\r\n60:       \"2023\": \"Q1 42/12=3.5000; Q2 41/12=3.4167; Q3 42/12=3.5000; Q4 43/12=3.5833; Q5 42/12=3.5000; Q6 41/12=3.4167; Q7 43/12=3.5833\",\r\n61:       \"2024\": \"Q1 3.5000; Q2 3.4167; Q3 3.5000; Q4 3.5833; Q5 48/12=4.0000; Q6 3.4167; Q7 47/12=3.9167\",\r\n62:       \"2025\": \"Q1 3.5000; Q2 47/12=3.9167; Q3 3.5000; Q4 3.5833; Q5 51/12=4.2500; Q6 3.4167; Q7 51/12=4.2500\"\r\n63:     },\r\n64:     \"pooled_index_recomputed\": \"2023 251/72=3.4861; 2024 257/72=3.5694; 2025 266/72=3.6944 — matches §陸-二 六構面綜合均值 row and §壹-一-2/§柒-一-1.\",\r\n65:     \"q7_top2_recomputed\": \"2023 7/12=58.33% (5 of 1–3, 7 of 4, 0 of 5); 2024 10/12=83.33% (2/9/1); 2025 11/12=91.67% (1/7/4) — matches §陸-三 including the 1–3/4/5 count columns and the 全期變化 row (-4 / 0 / +4).\",\r\n66:     \"deltas_recomputed\": \"Pooled 2023→2024 +0.0833, 2024→2025 +0.1250, 2023→2025 +0.2083; Q7 +0.3333 / +0.3333 / +0.6667; Q5 +0.5000 / +0.2500 / +0.7500; Q2 +0.0000 / +0.5000 / +0.5000 — all match §陸-二 and §柒-一.\",\r\n67:     \"percentage_points\": \"83.33−58.33=+25.00 pp; 91.67−83.33=+8.33 pp (unrounded 11/12−10/12=8.3333); full span +33.33 pp — matches §陸-三 and the 計算註 note.\",\r\n68:     \"denominators\": \"15 invited / 12 valid per year = 80.00% (12/15); three-year totals 45 / 36 / 80.00%; Q1–Q6 valid answers 6×12=72 per year and 216 in total; every item n=12 — consistent with §陸-I and the 說明 under it.\",\r\n69:     \"sensitivity\": \"2/12=0.1667 points (§柒-二-1) is arithmetically correct.\",\r\n70:     \"pooled_vs_mean_of_means\": \"Because all item n=12, the pooled ratio equals the arithmetic mean of the six item means (251/72 etc.); 附錄四 states this equality and requires the pooled ratio instead once item n differ — correct and Blueprint-conformant.\",\r\n71:     \"dataset_integrity\": \"附錄三 reproduces all 36 rows with IDs SYN-0141-YYYY-NNN, dates 2023-01-20…2025-12-20, cohort IDs and segment marks matching the canonical CSV; 附錄二 is declared outside the 36 rows and its answers (4,5,3,4,5,3,4) match FACT-SYN-0141-Q8-VIGNETTE.\",\r\n72:     \"discrepancies_found\": \"None numeric. No percentage-growth mislabelling of Likert deltas occurs; no N/A or blank is scored as zero; no imputation is proposed.\"\r\n73:   },\r\n74:   \"cross_document_identity\": {\r\n75:     \"dataset_vs_per_row_ids\": \"Header table 「報告版本與合成事實識別碼」 and 附錄四's sample_case_id entry define the dataset-level ID FACT-SYN-0141-SAT-TREND-R01 and the per-row ID as dataset ID + '-YYYY-NNN', stating that the dataset ID must not be used as a row ID. This matches the 36 per-row fact_ids in SAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_REGISTER_0141_R05.csv (5fff0f9b…) and removes the R04 sidecar/report mismatch.\",\r\n76:     \"shared_facts\": \"No shared real trainees, cohorts, years, rates or narrative are asserted with 0139/0140/0142; the adjacent documents appear only as exclusion boundaries (§貳-二 table and register related_docs).\",\r\n77:     \"source_lineage\": \"The DOCX cites the canonical R01 CSV by name and SHA (附錄五: 72325919…) and states that R05 is a text revision, not a new dataset (版本界線 note). Sidecar register locator/lineage residue is noted as minor finding 5.\",\r\n78:     \"no_cross_construct_metrics\": \"No employment, licensing, system-uptake or revenue metric is imported or blended into the satisfaction series.\"\r\n79:   },\r\n80:   \"neighboring_requirement_differentiation\": {\r\n81:     \"guard_present\": \"§貳-二 negative-neighbour guard and 附錄五 文件/要求 table pair 0141 with E29 (licensing/employment), E30 (information-system uptake), E32 (revenue) and state each is a different proof construct.\",\r\n82:     \"negative_neighbour_rejection\": \"Feeding a licensing/employment rate, LMS login/download rate or revenue figure as evidence of 「顧客滿意度提升」 would be visibly rejected by this document, so it cannot be substituted for 0139/0140/0142 nor they for it.\",\r\n83:     \"index_and_id_separation\": \"Index 155 is described as 「顧客滿意度上升：多期同量尺統計」 and kept distinct from the requirement ID and doc ID; the 4分 tier is not converted into an association score.\"\r\n84:   },\r\n85:   \"r04_findings_resolution\": [\r\n86:     {\r\n87:       \"prior_finding\": 1,\r\n88:       \"topic\": \"附錄二 Q1–Q7 題目 wording vs frozen instrument\",\r\n89:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED_WITH_RESIDUAL_COSMETIC_NOTE\",\r\n90:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄二 表「題號/題目（逐字引用凍結題項）」 Q1–Q7 rows, plus the note under the table\",\r\n91:       \"evidence\": \"Appendix II now reads 本次訓練服務內容符合我在報名前表達的需求 / 課程內容能對應我預計運用的工作志工或學習情境 / … and is byte-identical to QUESTIONNAIRE_ITEMS_0141_R01.csv, with an explicit note naming that CSV as the frozen item file. Semantic content is now identical to §伍 and 附錄一; only punctuation/whitespace normalization differs (see minor finding 1).\",\r\n92:       \"note\": \"The prior defect (paraphrased questions in a document presented as a completed record) is gone; remaining divergence is punctuation-level.\"\r\n93:     },\r\n94:     {\r\n95:       \"prior_finding\": 2,\r\n96:       \"topic\": \"Dimension-label drift in §柒\",\r\n97:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n98:       \"body_locator\": \"§柒-一 opening sentence; §陸-二 row labels; 附錄四 題項標籤對照表\",\r\n99:       \"evidence\": \"§柒-一 now declares the short-label set (需求契合、情境對應、師資支援、教材資源、行政溝通、環境設備、整體滿意) as the single source, and uses Q4（教材資源）, Q6（環境設備）; 附錄四 states 「Q4＝教材資源、Q6＝環境設備」 and maps each label to its CSV column and frozen text. 教材實用度/環境設備與線上平台 style drift is gone.\"\r\n100:     },\r\n101:     {\r\n102:       \"prior_finding\": 3,\r\n103:       \"topic\": \"Retrospective vs future timing of the two SAMPLE proposals\",\r\n104:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n105:       \"body_locator\": \"§捌 preamble; 方案一 「方案性質」「對應期別轉折（回溯對照）」「回查檢驗期程」; 方案二 same fields\",\r\n106:       \"evidence\": \"The preamble states both items are retrospective demonstrations on the completed 2023–2025 synthetic series and that 「不存在『先提案、後改善、再看到分數上升』的時序」. 方案一 anchors 2023→2025 and cites Q5 3.5000→4.2500 as a 累計量尺點差, not a before/after effect; 方案二 anchors 2024→2025 and cites Q2 3.4167→3.9167. Check windows are stated as not yet occurred and future-only, with the 10-working-day figure labelled a SAMPLE parameter.\"\r\n107:     },\r\n108:     {\r\n109:       \"prior_finding\": 4,\r\n110:       \"topic\": \"Item-level Top-2 denominator for 方案二's 75% threshold\",\r\n111:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n112:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄四-2 「單題 Top-2 正面滿意率（Item-level Top-2 Proportion）」; 方案二 「具體成效檢驗指標」\",\r\n113:       \"evidence\": \"A general item-level formula is added (分子/分母 both restricted to Qk valid answers, excluding N/A and blanks, not invitation count, not other items), with an explicit sentence that 方案二's Q2 Top-2 uses this Q2-specific denominator and that Q7 keeps its own formula. 方案二 now reads 「Top-2 佔比應突破 75%（分母為 Q2 自身有效回答數，見附錄四單題 Top-2 公式）」.\"\r\n114:     },\r\n115:     {\r\n116:       \"prior_finding\": 5,\r\n117:       \"topic\": \"Data-dictionary omissions (record_state / response_date_synthetic / customer_segment)\",\r\n118:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n119:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄四-1 欄位定義資料字典\",\r\n120:       \"evidence\": \"All three fields are now defined with type, value vocabulary and role: record_state (only allowed value SAMPLE_SYNTHETIC; REAL vocabulary UNKNOWN), response_date_synthetic (YYYY-MM-DD, fictional, not a real administration/sign-off date), customer_segment (only TRAINING_PARTICIPANT_SYNTHETIC present; declared the stratification key with a no-unstratified-merge rule). period_year, service_cohort_id, sample_case_id, Q1–Q8 remain defined.\"\r\n121:     },\r\n122:     {\r\n123:       \"prior_finding\": 6,\r\n124:       \"topic\": \"§拾 flow diagram reading as automatic CURRENT promotion\",\r\n125:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n126:       \"body_locator\": \"§拾-一 真實資料替換四步檢核流程 diagram, steps 4–5 and the terminal state box\",\r\n127:       \"evidence\": \"Step 4 now adds 「計算通過本身不會自動晉級，也不改變資料性質」; step 5 is 「授權角色審查（CURRENT 晉級關卡）」 with 由協會實際授權角色審查來源、權限、重算與獨立複核; the terminal box reads 「[狀態：CURRENT（候選）] CURRENT ≠ REAL，也不等於正式接受（formal acceptance）」, and §拾-二-4 repeats the same gate in prose.\"\r\n128:     }\r\n129:   ],\r\n130:   \"major_findings\": [],\r\n131:   \"minor_findings\": [\r\n132:     {\r\n133:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n134:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄二 「題號/題目（逐字引用凍結題項）」 Q1–Q7 cells and the note beneath the table; 附錄四 題項標籤對照表 「凍結題目文字」 column — compared with §伍-二 and 附錄一, which print 「本次訓練服務內容符合我在報名前表達的需求。」 and 「…工作、志工或學習情境。」\",\r\n135:       \"evidence\": \"Appendix II and the appendix IV label table omit the closing 。 and the enumeration mark 、 that appear in §伍 and 附錄一, because QUESTIONNAIRE_ITEMS_0141_R01.csv itself carries no punctuation or inter-word spaces. The note 「未增刪標點」 is literally true against the CSV but a reader comparing 附錄二 with §伍/附錄一 still sees two renderings of the frozen instrument, and an evaluator could ask which is the printed instrument.\",\r\n136:       \"required_action\": \"Add one sentence to the 附錄二 note and to 附錄四's label table stating that the CSV export normalizes punctuation/whitespace and that §伍/附錄一 carries the printable canonical wording (or restore 。 and 、 in the appendix cells). Byte-neutral for all published statistics.\"\r\n137:     },\r\n138:     {\r\n139:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n140:       \"body_locator\": \"§陸-一 各期樣本回收與有效母數彙總表, column 「核心題有效總填答次數」 (72 / 72 / 72 / 216) — read against §伍-二 「7 題核心量化題目」 and §參-三 comparability row 「核心量化 7 題（Q1–Q7）」\",\r\n141:       \"evidence\": \"The 72 figure is Q1–Q6 only (6 items × 12 responses), while two other passages define 「核心」 as seven items (Q1–Q7). The 說明 under the table does resolve it in prose, but the column header alone can be recomputed by an evaluator as 7×12=84 and read as an error.\",\r\n142:       \"required_action\": \"Rename the column to 「Q1–Q6 六構面有效填答次數」 (or define 「核心題＝Q1–Q6，整體題＝Q7」 immediately above the table). Byte-neutral.\"\r\n143:     },\r\n144:     {\r\n145:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n146:       \"body_locator\": \"§捌 方案一 「具體成效檢驗指標」 — 「Q5 有效均值應達到 3.8000 分以上，且無行政聯繫延誤之負面抱怨」\",\r\n147:       \"evidence\": \"The first half is measurable from the instrument (Q5 mean on the unchanged 1–5 scale). The second half has no defined collection source: 附錄三's Q8 is empty in all 36 rows and the document itself says no qualitative text exists, and no complaint/rework register, channel or counting rule is specified. §捌 方案一 also correctly disclaims using Q8 to support the problem statement, which makes the criterion's evidence base visibly undefined.\",\r\n148:       \"required_action\": \"Either define the evidence object for 「負面抱怨」 (e.g. an administrative complaint/rework log with owner, count window and escalation rule) and mark it SAMPLE-proposed, or restate the criterion in Q5 scale points only and note that the qualitative condition is currently UNKNOWN-sourced.\"\r\n149:     },\r\n150:     {\r\n151:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n152:       \"body_locator\": \"§壹-一-4 「Q5（行政溝通與課前通知）」「Q2（課程內容對應情境適切度）」「Q6（學習環境與設備）」 versus the declared single label set in §柒-一 and 附錄四\",\r\n153:       \"evidence\": \"§柒-一 states that no further aliases will be coined and 附錄四 freezes Q4＝教材資源 / Q6＝環境設備, yet §壹's executive bullets use longer descriptive parentheticals that differ from the frozen short labels. The numbers attached are correct, so only the label strings diverge, but a careful reader sees three label variants for Q2/Q5/Q6 across §壹, §柒 and 附錄四.\",\r\n154:       \"required_action\": \"Align §壹's parentheticals to the frozen short labels plus item IDs (e.g. 「Q5 行政溝通」, 「Q2 情境對應」, 「Q6 環境設備」), or drop the parentheticals and point to 附錄四.\"\r\n155:     },\r\n156:     {\r\n157:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n158:       \"body_locator\": \"Sidecar SAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_REGISTER_0141_R05.csv (5fff0f9b…): source_artifact and docx_locator columns for FACT-SYN-0141-FRAME-2023/2024/2025, -Q8-VIGNETTE, -SOP-PARAMS, -SUPPRESSION, -ACT-01 and -ACT-02\",\r\n159:       \"evidence\": \"Those eight non-row facts still cite MANUSCRIPT_0141_R02_REVIEWED.md as source_artifact and use English locators (「Appendix 3 row 1」, 「Section 6 summary」, 「Section 6 aggregates derive from this row」, 「Section 8 proposal one」) whereas the R05 DOCX uses 附錄三, §陸, §捌 and cites the R05 manuscript line. The 36 per-row fact IDs are corrected and consistent; only the non-row lineage pointers were not re-pointed for R05.\",\r\n160:       \"required_action\": \"Re-point those locators to the R05 manuscript and the Chinese section names used in the DOCX. No DOCX byte change is implied; if the register is treated as a promotion artifact, cite one canonical lineage at promotion.\"\r\n161:     }\r\n162:   ],\r\n163:   \"residual_gaps\": [\r\n164:     \"Printed checkbox serial remains UNKNOWN, declared honestly in the header table and not contradicted by 157 index 155; only an authoritative printed source can resolve it.\",\r\n165:     \"REAL evidence status remains UNKNOWN/HOLD: authorised roles, retention period, access control and privacy policy are deferred by design (保存期限 UNKNOWN / REFER_TO_APPROVED_POLICY), and SAMPLE cannot become REAL by computation, by formatting or by passing this review.\",\r\n166:     \"Q8 is empty across all 36 synthetic rows (declared in §壹, §陸 and both proposals), so the qualitative channel is structurally present but unexercised; the first REAL cycle must populate it before any qualitative claim or complaint-based criterion can be evidenced.\",\r\n167:     \"No segment-level result table exists because only one synthetic segment is surveyed; the first REAL cycle that includes corporate client windows must add stratified output per §參-I and gate rule 8.\",\r\n168:     \"The exact official meaning of the 4 分 cell remains a control-plane question; the page-9 extract shows a scoring tier and no weight column, and the document's neutral wording is consistent with that, but it cannot settle the printed label.\",\r\n169:     \"This review did not inspect the DOCX binary, Word rendering, chart geometry or page layout; the 25-page visual receipt (5076475e…) and the technical QA receipt (d4014756…) are separate lanes with their own SHAs and are corroborating, not verified here. The chart plots the pooled six-item index plus Q7 and the Q2/Q5/Q6 series and omits Q1/Q3/Q4 (disclosed in §陸-四); the caption note disambiguating the pooled index from any single item is present and materially reduces the misreading risk.\",\r\n170:     \"§拾-一 step 3 asks for 「不可逆對照表」 while §拾-二 and §伍 preserve an anonymous case-code mapping and §拾-一-2 allows retention of a re-identification key under approved policy; the phrase is defensible if read as file-level SHA lineage, but the wording could be tightened to 「檔案層級不可逆雜湊對照」 to avoid implying that identity re-linking is impossible.\",\r\n171:     \"Official score NOT_ASSIGNED and Human formal acceptance NOT_GRANTED: this candidate remains SAMPLE/CANDIDATE and must not be treated as REAL, approved, promoted or scored evidence on the strength of this semantic PASS.\"\r\n172:   ]\r\n173: }\r","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file E:\\TTQS\\TTQS_ONE_CODEX_RUNTIME\\WORK\\QUALITY_REBUILD_20261016\\0141_I19-E31_SOURCE_PREP_R01_20261025\\OPENCODE_REVIEW_PARSED_0141_R05.json, lines 1-173\n1: {\r\n2:   \"reviewed_docx_sha256\": \"3e9e6eef2769617dc4d515bb0d9abfa363a46e217b13b7c261b279306ced17d8\",\r\n3:   \"reviewed_text_sha256\": \"c13c350eb8fce0f891d36dc64c15682433b668df976708456d9e71ae31f59328\",\r\n4:   \"verdict\": \"PASS\",\r\n5:   \"review_scope\": {\r\n6:     \"mode\": \"SEMANTIC_TEXT_ONLY\",\r\n7:     \"target\": \"doc_id 0141 / requirement I19-E31 / 157 index 155 / candidate R05 (CANDIDATE, not CURRENT, not REAL, not formally accepted)\",\r\n8:     \"inspected\": \"Only the extracted text asserted to belong to DOCX SHA-256 3e9e6eef2769617dc4d515bb0d9abfa363a46e217b13b7c261b279306ced17d8 (text SHA-256 c13c350e…). No DOCX binary, Word COM render, page image, PDF text layer or chart pixel was inspected by this review.\",\r\n9:     \"independent_work\": \"Recalculated every published figure directly from the 36 data rows of SAMPLE_SURVEY_RESPONSES_0141_R01.csv (SHA-256 72325919…): per-item sums and means, pooled six-item ratios, Q7 means, Q7 Top-2 counts/rates, all point deltas and percentage-point deltas, return rates, the 72/216 valid-answer counts and the n=12 sensitivity figure. The R05 math/technical/visual receipts were read only as claimed surrounding evidence, not as my own findings.\",\r\n10:     \"compared_against\": [\r\n11:       \"OFFICIAL_REQUIREMENT_ROW_I19-E31.json (d18d41bd…)\",\r\n12:       \"OFFICIAL_SOURCE_PAGE9_EXCERPT.txt (0733c1e3…)\",\r\n13:       \"CROSSWALK_ROW_0141_AND_NEIGHBORS.json (d09422ce…), including I19-E29/E30/E32 neighbours\",\r\n14:       \"UNIQUE_BLUEPRINT_0141_I19-E31_R02.md (e1976164…)\",\r\n15:       \"SOURCE_PACKET_0141_I19-E31_R02.md (43c0e1bd…)\",\r\n16:       \"QUESTIONNAIRE_ITEMS_0141_R01.csv (310745e5…)\",\r\n17:       \"SAMPLE_PERIOD_SUMMARY_0141_R01.csv (537c39dc…)\",\r\n18:       \"SAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_REGISTER_0141_R05.csv (5fff0f9b…)\"\r\n19:     ],\r\n20:     \"not_inherited\": \"The prior exact-SHA R04 PASS (a0dfec32…) and its six minor findings were treated as context to be re-verified, not as a verdict for this SHA.\",\r\n21:     \"not_adjudicated\": \"Word-native layout/pagination, chart geometry, font floors and the 25-page visual receipt (5076475e…) are a separate lane; they are corroborating context only and are not re-adjudicated here.\",\r\n22:     \"status_boundaries\": \"REAL evidence = UNKNOWN/HOLD; Official score = NOT_ASSIGNED; Human formal acceptance = NOT_GRANTED. This PASS is semantic-only for the exact SHA above and promotes nothing.\"\r\n23:   },\r\n24:   \"requirement_mapping\": {\r\n25:     \"official_requirement\": \"I19-E31, indicator 19, official criterion 「顧客滿意度提升。」, source = TTQS training-institution scoring evidence table, physical PDF page 9 (page extraction SHA 945949f3…).\",\r\n26:     \"official_label_reading\": \"「4分」 appears inside the 1–5 計分標準 tier list on the page-9 extract; the extract shows no weight column. The document states this correctly at §貳-一 and in the 報告基本資訊 table (「將 4 分列在 1–5 分計分級距中，未顯示為權重欄」), and does not assert a weight, an association score or evaluator-granted points.\",\r\n27:     \"identity_triangulation\": \"doc_id 0141, requirement I19-E31 and 157 index 155 are carried as three distinct identifiers in the header table, §貳-一 and 附錄五-2; printed checkbox serial is declared UNKNOWN rather than guessed.\",\r\n28:     \"title_provenance\": \"The title 「顧客滿意度趨勢調查與分析報告」 is attributed to the 129→142 crosswalk I19-E31/0141 row and explicitly not to the page-9 PDF text (header table 「文件名稱來源」) — matches the crosswalk row and the Blueprint B note.\",\r\n29:     \"blueprint_D_coverage\": {\r\n30:       \"cover_status_D1\": \"Header table + 壹 declares whole-document SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC and REAL=UNKNOWN/HOLD.\",\r\n31:       \"executive_finding_D2\": \"§壹-一/二 give three-period means, 15/12 denominators, Q6 as weakest dimension, interpretation and limits.\",\r\n32:       \"comparability_protocol_D3\": \"§參-I/II/III/IV: audience definition, single synthetic segment, invitation-unit denominator rule, four comparability conditions, small-cell SAMPLE caveat.\",\r\n33:       \"administration_SOP_D4\": \"§肆-I/II: dispatch timing, two-reminder cap, close at day 5, dedup, invalidity rules, no-imputation, item-specific valid n, 5/6 personal-index threshold.\",\r\n34:       \"questionnaire_D5\": \"§伍-一/二: full 1–5 anchor definitions, N/A handling, 8 items with metadata fields; Q8 explicitly excluded from numeric means.\",\r\n35:       \"results_D6\": \"§陸-I/II/III/IV: invitation/valid/return counts, six item means with n=12, separate Q7 mean and Top-2 table, multi-period table and same-axis line chart with caption note.\",\r\n36:       \"interpretation_D7\": \"§柒-一/二: 2023→2024, 2024→2025 and baseline→final deltas, weakest item Q6, sample-size sensitivity, no-causality and single-segment limitations.\",\r\n37:       \"sample_loop_D8\": \"§捌: two proposals with IDs, retrospective framing, proposed role, future check window, success measure, HOLD/REVISE rule, NOT_ADOPTED/NOT_EXECUTED status.\",\r\n38:       \"limitations_decision_D9\": \"§捌 次期資料判讀與處置表 (CONTINUE/CHANGE/HOLD with required evidence) plus §柒-二.\",\r\n39:       \"appendices_D10\": \"附錄一 blank printable form, 附錄二 filled SAMPLE example, 附錄三 36-row dataset, 附錄四 dictionary/formulas/label table, 附錄五 register template and revision history.\"\r\n40:     },\r\n41:     \"blueprint_I_reject_checks\": \"None of the 13 reject/hold conditions is triggered by this text: IDs are not conflated; a filled SAMPLE example plus 36 rows exist; scale/wording held constant with an explicit TREND_NOT_COMPARABLE_HOLD rule; denominators and per-item n stated; N/A/blank not imputed or zeroed; Likert deltas labelled in points, not percent growth; nonresponse handled by invitation denominator and gate rule 7; segment blending prohibited; synthetic status labelled on every table; satisfaction not substituted for licensing/employment/system-use/revenue; causality explicitly barred; owner roles, checkpoints and HOLD rules supplied; SHA/source locators attached.\"\r\n42:   },\r\n43:   \"document_genre_and_usability\": {\r\n44:     \"genre\": \"調査與分析報告 (survey and analysis report) — not a scoring sheet, not a blank questionnaire, not an information-system uptake report, not a licensing/employment report, not a revenue report.\",\r\n45:     \"title_blind_identification\": \"Reading only the body, an evaluator would identify a three-period customer-satisfaction trend report with protocol, instrument, statistics, limits and a proposal loop.\",\r\n46:     \"practical_field_usability\": \"Usable before launch: the invitation unit and denominator rule (§參-II), dispatch/reminder/close timings (§肆-I), dedup and invalidity rules (§肆-II), the printable blank form (附錄一) and the filled example (附錄二) are all present. The 附錄四 dictionary now carries record_state, response_date_synthetic and customer_segment with vocabularies, so a future REAL export can be validated against the dictionary rather than the raw CSV header.\",\r\n47:     \"evaluator_facing_readability\": \"Sections are numbered and cross-referenced (柒-一 points to 附錄四's label table; 方案二 points to 附錄四's item-level Top-2 formula; 陸-四's caption disambiguates the pooled index from any single item). Warning blocks and SAMPLE labels appear on every results table.\",\r\n48:     \"label_consistency\": \"Short labels 需求契合/情境對應/師資支援/教材資源/行政溝通/環境設備/整體滿意 are used in §陸-二, §柒-一 and 附錄四, and §柒-一 now states that these are the single label source with no new aliases; 附錄四 fixes Q4＝教材資源 and Q6＝環境設備. Residual descriptive parentheticals in §壹-四 (e.g. 「Q5（行政溝通與課前通知）」, 「Q6（學習環境與設備）」) are the only remaining alias-like strings — cosmetic, see minor finding 4.\"\r\n49:   },\r\n50:   \"sample_real_boundary\": {\r\n51:     \"labelling\": \"Header table, §壹, §陸-I, 附錄二, 附錄三 row column 「資料屬性狀態」 and 附錄五 all state SAMPLE/SYNTHETIC; every 36 rows carries record_state=SAMPLE_SYNTHETIC and Q8='SAMPLE_ONLY; no actual respondent text'.\",\r\n52:     \"real_status\": \"REAL = UNKNOWN / HOLD in the header table, §拾-二-1 and the closing line; 保存期限 UNKNOWN / REFER_TO_APPROVED_POLICY.\",\r\n53:     \"authority_boundary\": \"§捌 次期 table step 3 (由協會實際授權人員決定) plus §拾-一 step 5 and §拾-二-4 state that computation alone never promotes: 「CURRENT ≠ REAL，也不等於正式接受」 and 「Human formal acceptance 未授予」. No meeting decision, signature, approval, certificate, third-party original or external achievement is fabricated.\",\r\n54:     \"synthetic_segment\": \"Exactly one segment (TRAINING_PARTICIPANT_SYNTHETIC) exists in the 36 rows; §參-I and §柒-二-4 state that no corporate-client or other segment is surveyed and that no segment comparison may be drawn. No unsupported inference to other segments is made.\",\r\n55:     \"no_causality\": \"§壹-二, §柒-一-5, §柒-二-3 and gate rule 11 bar any claim that the two proposals caused the Q5/Q2/Q7 movement; the proposals are labelled retrospective demonstrations with NOT_ADOPTED/NOT_EXECUTED status.\"\r\n56:   },\r\n57:   \"math_and_data\": {\r\n58:     \"method\": \"Recomputed from the 36 raw rows without using the R01 period summary or the R05 math receipt as authority.\",\r\n59:     \"per_item_means_recomputed\": {\r\n60:       \"2023\": \"Q1 42/12=3.5000; Q2 41/12=3.4167; Q3 42/12=3.5000; Q4 43/12=3.5833; Q5 42/12=3.5000; Q6 41/12=3.4167; Q7 43/12=3.5833\",\r\n61:       \"2024\": \"Q1 3.5000; Q2 3.4167; Q3 3.5000; Q4 3.5833; Q5 48/12=4.0000; Q6 3.4167; Q7 47/12=3.9167\",\r\n62:       \"2025\": \"Q1 3.5000; Q2 47/12=3.9167; Q3 3.5000; Q4 3.5833; Q5 51/12=4.2500; Q6 3.4167; Q7 51/12=4.2500\"\r\n63:     },\r\n64:     \"pooled_index_recomputed\": \"2023 251/72=3.4861; 2024 257/72=3.5694; 2025 266/72=3.6944 — matches §陸-二 六構面綜合均值 row and §壹-一-2/§柒-一-1.\",\r\n65:     \"q7_top2_recomputed\": \"2023 7/12=58.33% (5 of 1–3, 7 of 4, 0 of 5); 2024 10/12=83.33% (2/9/1); 2025 11/12=91.67% (1/7/4) — matches §陸-三 including the 1–3/4/5 count columns and the 全期變化 row (-4 / 0 / +4).\",\r\n66:     \"deltas_recomputed\": \"Pooled 2023→2024 +0.0833, 2024→2025 +0.1250, 2023→2025 +0.2083; Q7 +0.3333 / +0.3333 / +0.6667; Q5 +0.5000 / +0.2500 / +0.7500; Q2 +0.0000 / +0.5000 / +0.5000 — all match §陸-二 and §柒-一.\",\r\n67:     \"percentage_points\": \"83.33−58.33=+25.00 pp; 91.67−83.33=+8.33 pp (unrounded 11/12−10/12=8.3333); full span +33.33 pp — matches §陸-三 and the 計算註 note.\",\r\n68:     \"denominators\": \"15 invited / 12 valid per year = 80.00% (12/15); three-year totals 45 / 36 / 80.00%; Q1–Q6 valid answers 6×12=72 per year and 216 in total; every item n=12 — consistent with §陸-I and the 說明 under it.\",\r\n69:     \"sensitivity\": \"2/12=0.1667 points (§柒-二-1) is arithmetically correct.\",\r\n70:     \"pooled_vs_mean_of_means\": \"Because all item n=12, the pooled ratio equals the arithmetic mean of the six item means (251/72 etc.); 附錄四 states this equality and requires the pooled ratio instead once item n differ — correct and Blueprint-conformant.\",\r\n71:     \"dataset_integrity\": \"附錄三 reproduces all 36 rows with IDs SYN-0141-YYYY-NNN, dates 2023-01-20…2025-12-20, cohort IDs and segment marks matching the canonical CSV; 附錄二 is declared outside the 36 rows and its answers (4,5,3,4,5,3,4) match FACT-SYN-0141-Q8-VIGNETTE.\",\r\n72:     \"discrepancies_found\": \"None numeric. No percentage-growth mislabelling of Likert deltas occurs; no N/A or blank is scored as zero; no imputation is proposed.\"\r\n73:   },\r\n74:   \"cross_document_identity\": {\r\n75:     \"dataset_vs_per_row_ids\": \"Header table 「報告版本與合成事實識別碼」 and 附錄四's sample_case_id entry define the dataset-level ID FACT-SYN-0141-SAT-TREND-R01 and the per-row ID as dataset ID + '-YYYY-NNN', stating that the dataset ID must not be used as a row ID. This matches the 36 per-row fact_ids in SAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_REGISTER_0141_R05.csv (5fff0f9b…) and removes the R04 sidecar/report mismatch.\",\r\n76:     \"shared_facts\": \"No shared real trainees, cohorts, years, rates or narrative are asserted with 0139/0140/0142; the adjacent documents appear only as exclusion boundaries (§貳-二 table and register related_docs).\",\r\n77:     \"source_lineage\": \"The DOCX cites the canonical R01 CSV by name and SHA (附錄五: 72325919…) and states that R05 is a text revision, not a new dataset (版本界線 note). Sidecar register locator/lineage residue is noted as minor finding 5.\",\r\n78:     \"no_cross_construct_metrics\": \"No employment, licensing, system-uptake or revenue metric is imported or blended into the satisfaction series.\"\r\n79:   },\r\n80:   \"neighboring_requirement_differentiation\": {\r\n81:     \"guard_present\": \"§貳-二 negative-neighbour guard and 附錄五 文件/要求 table pair 0141 with E29 (licensing/employment), E30 (information-system uptake), E32 (revenue) and state each is a different proof construct.\",\r\n82:     \"negative_neighbour_rejection\": \"Feeding a licensing/employment rate, LMS login/download rate or revenue figure as evidence of 「顧客滿意度提升」 would be visibly rejected by this document, so it cannot be substituted for 0139/0140/0142 nor they for it.\",\r\n83:     \"index_and_id_separation\": \"Index 155 is described as 「顧客滿意度上升：多期同量尺統計」 and kept distinct from the requirement ID and doc ID; the 4分 tier is not converted into an association score.\"\r\n84:   },\r\n85:   \"r04_findings_resolution\": [\r\n86:     {\r\n87:       \"prior_finding\": 1,\r\n88:       \"topic\": \"附錄二 Q1–Q7 題目 wording vs frozen instrument\",\r\n89:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED_WITH_RESIDUAL_COSMETIC_NOTE\",\r\n90:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄二 表「題號/題目（逐字引用凍結題項）」 Q1–Q7 rows, plus the note under the table\",\r\n91:       \"evidence\": \"Appendix II now reads 本次訓練服務內容符合我在報名前表達的需求 / 課程內容能對應我預計運用的工作志工或學習情境 / … and is byte-identical to QUESTIONNAIRE_ITEMS_0141_R01.csv, with an explicit note naming that CSV as the frozen item file. Semantic content is now identical to §伍 and 附錄一; only punctuation/whitespace normalization differs (see minor finding 1).\",\r\n92:       \"note\": \"The prior defect (paraphrased questions in a document presented as a completed record) is gone; remaining divergence is punctuation-level.\"\r\n93:     },\r\n94:     {\r\n95:       \"prior_finding\": 2,\r\n96:       \"topic\": \"Dimension-label drift in §柒\",\r\n97:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n98:       \"body_locator\": \"§柒-一 opening sentence; §陸-二 row labels; 附錄四 題項標籤對照表\",\r\n99:       \"evidence\": \"§柒-一 now declares the short-label set (需求契合、情境對應、師資支援、教材資源、行政溝通、環境設備、整體滿意) as the single source, and uses Q4（教材資源）, Q6（環境設備）; 附錄四 states 「Q4＝教材資源、Q6＝環境設備」 and maps each label to its CSV column and frozen text. 教材實用度/環境設備與線上平台 style drift is gone.\"\r\n100:     },\r\n101:     {\r\n102:       \"prior_finding\": 3,\r\n103:       \"topic\": \"Retrospective vs future timing of the two SAMPLE proposals\",\r\n104:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n105:       \"body_locator\": \"§捌 preamble; 方案一 「方案性質」「對應期別轉折（回溯對照）」「回查檢驗期程」; 方案二 same fields\",\r\n106:       \"evidence\": \"The preamble states both items are retrospective demonstrations on the completed 2023–2025 synthetic series and that 「不存在『先提案、後改善、再看到分數上升』的時序」. 方案一 anchors 2023→2025 and cites Q5 3.5000→4.2500 as a 累計量尺點差, not a before/after effect; 方案二 anchors 2024→2025 and cites Q2 3.4167→3.9167. Check windows are stated as not yet occurred and future-only, with the 10-working-day figure labelled a SAMPLE parameter.\"\r\n107:     },\r\n108:     {\r\n109:       \"prior_finding\": 4,\r\n110:       \"topic\": \"Item-level Top-2 denominator for 方案二's 75% threshold\",\r\n111:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n112:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄四-2 「單題 Top-2 正面滿意率（Item-level Top-2 Proportion）」; 方案二 「具體成效檢驗指標」\",\r\n113:       \"evidence\": \"A general item-level formula is added (分子/分母 both restricted to Qk valid answers, excluding N/A and blanks, not invitation count, not other items), with an explicit sentence that 方案二's Q2 Top-2 uses this Q2-specific denominator and that Q7 keeps its own formula. 方案二 now reads 「Top-2 佔比應突破 75%（分母為 Q2 自身有效回答數，見附錄四單題 Top-2 公式）」.\"\r\n114:     },\r\n115:     {\r\n116:       \"prior_finding\": 5,\r\n117:       \"topic\": \"Data-dictionary omissions (record_state / response_date_synthetic / customer_segment)\",\r\n118:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n119:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄四-1 欄位定義資料字典\",\r\n120:       \"evidence\": \"All three fields are now defined with type, value vocabulary and role: record_state (only allowed value SAMPLE_SYNTHETIC; REAL vocabulary UNKNOWN), response_date_synthetic (YYYY-MM-DD, fictional, not a real administration/sign-off date), customer_segment (only TRAINING_PARTICIPANT_SYNTHETIC present; declared the stratification key with a no-unstratified-merge rule). period_year, service_cohort_id, sample_case_id, Q1–Q8 remain defined.\"\r\n121:     },\r\n122:     {\r\n123:       \"prior_finding\": 6,\r\n124:       \"topic\": \"§拾 flow diagram reading as automatic CURRENT promotion\",\r\n125:       \"status\": \"RESOLVED\",\r\n126:       \"body_locator\": \"§拾-一 真實資料替換四步檢核流程 diagram, steps 4–5 and the terminal state box\",\r\n127:       \"evidence\": \"Step 4 now adds 「計算通過本身不會自動晉級，也不改變資料性質」; step 5 is 「授權角色審查（CURRENT 晉級關卡）」 with 由協會實際授權角色審查來源、權限、重算與獨立複核; the terminal box reads 「[狀態：CURRENT（候選）] CURRENT ≠ REAL，也不等於正式接受（formal acceptance）」, and §拾-二-4 repeats the same gate in prose.\"\r\n128:     }\r\n129:   ],\r\n130:   \"major_findings\": [],\r\n131:   \"minor_findings\": [\r\n132:     {\r\n133:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n134:       \"body_locator\": \"附錄二 「題號/題目（逐字引用凍結題項）」 Q1–Q7 cells and the note beneath the table; 附錄四 題項標籤對照表 「凍結題目文字」 column — compared with §伍-二 and 附錄一, which print 「本次訓練服務內容符合我在報名前表達的需求。」 and 「…工作、志工或學習情境。」\",\r\n135:       \"evidence\": \"Appendix II and the appendix IV label table omit the closing 。 and the enumeration mark 、 that appear in §伍 and 附錄一, because QUESTIONNAIRE_ITEMS_0141_R01.csv itself carries no punctuation or inter-word spaces. The note 「未增刪標點」 is literally true against the CSV but a reader comparing 附錄二 with §伍/附錄一 still sees two renderings of the frozen instrument, and an evaluator could ask which is the printed instrument.\",\r\n136:       \"required_action\": \"Add one sentence to the 附錄二 note and to 附錄四's label table stating that the CSV export normalizes punctuation/whitespace and that §伍/附錄一 carries the printable canonical wording (or restore 。 and 、 in the appendix cells). Byte-neutral for all published statistics.\"\r\n137:     },\r\n138:     {\r\n139:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n140:       \"body_locator\": \"§陸-一 各期樣本回收與有效母數彙總表, column 「核心題有效總填答次數」 (72 / 72 / 72 / 216) — read against §伍-二 「7 題核心量化題目」 and §參-三 comparability row 「核心量化 7 題（Q1–Q7）」\",\r\n141:       \"evidence\": \"The 72 figure is Q1–Q6 only (6 items × 12 responses), while two other passages define 「核心」 as seven items (Q1–Q7). The 說明 under the table does resolve it in prose, but the column header alone can be recomputed by an evaluator as 7×12=84 and read as an error.\",\r\n142:       \"required_action\": \"Rename the column to 「Q1–Q6 六構面有效填答次數」 (or define 「核心題＝Q1–Q6，整體題＝Q7」 immediately above the table). Byte-neutral.\"\r\n143:     },\r\n144:     {\r\n145:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n146:       \"body_locator\": \"§捌 方案一 「具體成效檢驗指標」 — 「Q5 有效均值應達到 3.8000 分以上，且無行政聯繫延誤之負面抱怨」\",\r\n147:       \"evidence\": \"The first half is measurable from the instrument (Q5 mean on the unchanged 1–5 scale). The second half has no defined collection source: 附錄三's Q8 is empty in all 36 rows and the document itself says no qualitative text exists, and no complaint/rework register, channel or counting rule is specified. §捌 方案一 also correctly disclaims using Q8 to support the problem statement, which makes the criterion's evidence base visibly undefined.\",\r\n148:       \"required_action\": \"Either define the evidence object for 「負面抱怨」 (e.g. an administrative complaint/rework log with owner, count window and escalation rule) and mark it SAMPLE-proposed, or restate the criterion in Q5 scale points only and note that the qualitative condition is currently UNKNOWN-sourced.\"\r\n149:     },\r\n150:     {\r\n151:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n152:       \"body_locator\": \"§壹-一-4 「Q5（行政溝通與課前通知）」「Q2（課程內容對應情境適切度）」「Q6（學習環境與設備）」 versus the declared single label set in §柒-一 and 附錄四\",\r\n153:       \"evidence\": \"§柒-一 states that no further aliases will be coined and 附錄四 freezes Q4＝教材資源 / Q6＝環境設備, yet §壹's executive bullets use longer descriptive parentheticals that differ from the frozen short labels. The numbers attached are correct, so only the label strings diverge, but a careful reader sees three label variants for Q2/Q5/Q6 across §壹, §柒 and 附錄四.\",\r\n154:       \"required_action\": \"Align §壹's parentheticals to the frozen short labels plus item IDs (e.g. 「Q5 行政溝通」, 「Q2 情境對應」, 「Q6 環境設備」), or drop the parentheticals and point to 附錄四.\"\r\n155:     },\r\n156:     {\r\n157:       \"severity\": \"MINOR\",\r\n158:       \"body_locator\": \"Sidecar SAMPLE_REPLACEMENT_REGISTER_0141_R05.csv (5fff0f9b…): source_artifact and docx_locator columns for FACT-SYN-0141-FRAME-2023/2024/2025, -Q8-VIGNETTE, -SOP-PARAMS, -SUPPRESSION, -ACT-01 and -ACT-02\",\r\n159:       \"evidence\": \"Those eight non-row facts still cite MANUSCRIPT_0141_R02_REVIEWED.md as source_artifact and use English locators (「Appendix 3 row 1」, 「Section 6 summary」, 「Section 6 aggregates derive from this row」, 「Section 8 proposal one」) whereas the R05 DOCX uses 附錄三, §陸, §捌 and cites the R05 manuscript line. The 36 per-row fact IDs are corrected and consistent; only the non-row lineage pointers were not re-pointed for R05.\",\r\n160:       \"required_action\": \"Re-point those locators to the R05 manuscript and the Chinese section names used in the DOCX. No DOCX byte change is implied; if the register is treated as a promotion artifact, cite one canonical lineage at promotion.\"\r\n161:     }\r\n162:   ],\r\n163:   \"residual_gaps\": [\r\n164:     \"Printed checkbox serial remains UNKNOWN, declared honestly in the header table and not contradicted by 157 index 155; only an authoritative printed source can resolve it.\",\r\n165:     \"REAL evidence status remains UNKNOWN/HOLD: authorised roles, retention period, access control and privacy policy are deferred by design (保存期限 UNKNOWN / REFER_TO_APPROVED_POLICY), and SAMPLE cannot become REAL by computation, by formatting or by passing this review.\",\r\n166:     \"Q8 is empty across all 36 synthetic rows (declared in §壹, §陸 and both proposals), so the qualitative channel is structurally present but unexercised; the first REAL cycle must populate it before any qualitative claim or complaint-based criterion can be evidenced.\",\r\n167:     \"No segment-level result table exists because only one synthetic segment is surveyed; the first REAL cycle that includes corporate client windows must add stratified output per §參-I and gate rule 8.\",\r\n168:     \"The exact official meaning of the 4 分 cell remains a control-plane question; the page-9 extract shows a scoring tier and no weight column, and the document's neutral wording is consistent with that, but it cannot settle the printed label.\",\r\n169:     \"This review did not inspect the DOCX binary, Word rendering, chart geometry or page layout; the 25-page visual receipt (5076475e…) and the technical QA receipt (d4014756…) are separate lanes with their own SHAs and are corroborating, not verified here. The chart plots the pooled six-item index plus Q7 and the Q2/Q5/Q6 series and omits Q1/Q3/Q4 (disclosed in §陸-四); the caption note disambiguating the pooled index from any single item is present and materially reduces the misreading risk.\",\r\n170:     \"§拾-一 step 3 asks for 「不可逆對照表」 while §拾-二 and §伍 preserve an anonymous case-code mapping and §拾-一-2 allows retention of a re-identification key under approved policy; the phrase is defensible if read as file-level SHA lineage, but the wording could be tightened to 「檔案層級不可逆雜湊對照」 to avoid implying that identity re-linking is impossible.\",\r\n171:     \"Official score NOT_ASSIGNED and Human formal acceptance NOT_GRANTED: this candidate remains SAMPLE/CANDIDATE and must not be treated as REAL, approved, promoted or scored evidence on the strength of this semantic PASS.\"\r\n172:   ]\r\n173: }\r"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"E:\\\\TTQS\\\\TTQS_ONE_CODEX_RUNTIME\\\\WORK\\\\QUALITY_REBUILD_20261016\\\\0141_I19-E31_SOURCE_PREP_R01_20261025\\\\OPENCODE_REVIEW_PARSED_0141_R05.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1792890868231,"end":1792890869123}}}}
